      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This weekday Amidah was offered by Miriam Rubin as an exercise during the Davvening Leadership Training Initiative (Week 3). She writes, “I began writing this July of 2024 when I was still pregnant and finished it in February of 2025 when my daughter was about 4 months old.” This form of Amidah can also be found in Seder Ḥibbur Berakhot, the earliest example of Italian liturgy. For comparison, find Reb Zalman’s alternative Amidah and Affirmations.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
